WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:06.372
- ROOMMATE MEETING.

00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:07.340
ROOMMATE MEETING!

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:10.376
- GOGO, WHAT THE HELL?
I'VE GOT A HANGOVER!

00:00:10.409 --> 00:00:11.778
- I DON'T GIVE A [bleep]

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.113
ABOUT YOUR HANGOVER,
OKAY, BRENDAN?

00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:18.217
I WANT A ROOMMATE MEETING,
AND I WANT IT NOW!

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.051
OKAY.

00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:21.387
NOW, SOMEBODY'S
BEEN TAKING [bleep]

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.522
OUT OF THE REFRIGERATOR

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.057
AND THROWING IT
ON THE GROUND,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:25.691
AND IT'S PISSING ME OFF.

00:00:25.724 --> 00:00:28.094
IS THIS ANOTHER ONE
OF YOUR STUPID PRANKS, JONALD?

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:30.563
- NO.
AND YOUR PRANKS ARE STUPID.

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:33.166
- IS IT YOU, MONDAY?
- WHAT?

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.467
[eerie music]
- I SAID,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.269
SOMEBODY'S BEEN TAKING [bleep]
OUT OF THE FRIDGE

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.770
AND THROWING IT
ON THE [bleep] GROUND.

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:39.405
AND I WANT TO KNOW
WHO IT IS,

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:41.441
BECAUSE IT'S NOT FUNNY!

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:42.575
- WELL, WHAT I WANT TO KNOW IS,

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:44.310
WHO KEEPS PULLING THE SHEETS
OFF MY BED

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:46.279
AND HANGING THEM
FROM THE CEILING FAN AT NIGHT?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.815
- WAS THAT YOU, MONDAY?
- WHAT?

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.284
- HAVE YOU BEEN TAKING
EVERYBODY'S SHEETS OFF THEM

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.420
IN THE NIGHT AND HANGING THEM
FROM THE CEILING FANS?

00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:55.588
- WHAT? NO.

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:58.424
- WELL, CLEARLY,
SOMEONE'S BEEN DOING THAT!

00:00:58.457 --> 00:00:59.692
[glass shatters]
- WHOA!

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:01.160
WHO DID THAT?

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:03.830
- YEAH! WHO THE [bleep]
JUST DID THAT?

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.232
- WHICH ONE OF YOU
JUST THREW THAT BOTTLE?

00:01:06.265 --> 00:01:08.334
- WHAT ARE WE EVEN TALKING
ABOUT RIGHT NOW?

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:10.803
- DID YOU [bleep]ING THROW
THAT BOTTLE, JONALD?

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:12.438
- NO, GOGO!

00:01:12.471 --> 00:01:14.874
[bleep] YOU!
I DIDN'T THROW IT!

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:17.543
- WELL, DID YOU [bleep]ING THROW
THAT BOTTLE, BRENDON?

00:01:17.576 --> 00:01:20.313
- YEAH!
YOU WOULD DO THAT, BRENDON.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:23.316
- DUDE, NO!
I DIDN'T THROW THE BOTTLE!

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:26.419
- WELL, SOMEBODY THREW
THAT [bleep]ING BOTTLE,

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:28.754
AND YOU'RE THE ONE WHO DREW
DICKS ON EVERYONE'S FOREHEAD!

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:30.790
- YEAH, YOU DID DO THAT!

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:32.692
- BUT DICKS ARE HILARIOUS,
THOUGH!

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.527
THIS IS JUST DESTRUCTIVE!

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:36.162
WHAT ABOUT YOU, MONDAY?

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.597
DID YOU THROW THAT BOTTLE?

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.398
[low growl]
- WHAT BOTTLE?

00:01:39.431 --> 00:01:41.868
- THE [bleep]ING BOTTLE, DUDE!

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.669
IT JUST SMASHED
AGAINST THE WALL,

00:01:43.702 --> 00:01:45.671
AND YOU EVEN SAID
SOME [bleep] ABOUT IT!

00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:48.341
- WELL, I DIDN'T THROW
A BOTTLE.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:51.344
- WELL, OBVIOUSLY,
IT WASN'T PING.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.479
HE'S GOT THE BEST GRADES
IN THE HOUSE.

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:56.883
- [hisses]

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.417
- GOOD POINT, PING.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:02:00.920
COME ON, GUYS, LET'S COOL IT
WITH THE PROFANITY.

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.256
YOU KNOW PING'S VERY RELIGIOUS.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.892
- [growls]

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.894
[guys groaning]

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:10.196
- AW, PING!
- UGH!

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.498
- COME ON!

00:02:12.531 --> 00:02:13.797
[spooky soul music]

